<h1>Elumai</h1>
<p class='text-mute'>
  Elumai is a Canadian AI company developing next-generation adaptive learning technology. Their platform integrates a proprietary cognitive profiling engine that powers one-on-one AI tutoring, capable of dynamically adjusting explanations, pacing, and visuals in real time. The system analyzes the user’s emotional state across 150 categories, such as anger, fatigue, happiness, stress, and frustration. It uses that analysis to choose the best response and learning path, delivering educational content in a more engaging and personalized way.
</p>

